# Placement Management System

## Project Overview
This project automates the Placement Management System using Salesforce Flows, Validation Rules, and Apex.

## Features
- Record-Triggered Flow to set Application Date
- Validation Rules for CGPA, Application Date, and Mandatory Fields
- Automatic Email Notification
- Offer Letter creation when Status becomes Selected

## Validation Rules

### CGPA Validation
Student__r.CGPA__c < Job__r.Minimum_CGPA__c

### Application Date Validation
Application_Date__c > Job__r.Last_Date__c

### Mandatory Fields
OR(
ISBLANK(Student__c),
ISBLANK(Job__c)
)

## Answers

### 1. Which requirements did you solve using Flow?
- Automatically set Application Date
- Send Email Notification
- Create Offer Letter when Status becomes Selected

### 2. Which requirements required Validation Rules?
- CGPA validation
- Application Date validation
- Mandatory field validation

### 3. Which requirements still needed Apex?
- Complex business logic
- Bulk processing
- Advanced automation

### 4. Why did you choose those solutions?
Flow was used for declarative automation without code.
Validation Rules were used to ensure data quality.
Apex was used where complex business logic and bulk processing were required.

